            }
        ],
        "abstract": "Automatic analytical instrumentation may be classified into three broad categories: instruments which measure physical properties of chemical compounds, instruments which automate procedures of analytical chemistry, instruments which perform a quantitative separation of the constituents of a mixture. Each of these categories will be discussed. The process gas chromatograph will be discussed in considerable detail.",
